{"1":{"w":[{"c":"سَأَلَ","d":"sa-ala","e":"Asked"},{"c":"سَائِلٌ","d":"sāilun","e":"a questioner"},{"c":"بِعَذَابٍ","d":"biʿadhābin","e":"for a punishment"},{"c":"وَاقِعٍ","d":"wāqiʿin","e":"bound to happen"}],"a":{"g":"A supplicant asked for a punishment bound to happen"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"لِلْكَافِرِينَ","d":"lil'kāfirīna","e":"To the disbelievers"},{"c":"لَيْسَ","d":"laysa","e":"not"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"of it"},{"c":"دَافِعٌ","d":"dāfiʿun","e":"any preventer"}],"a":{"g":"To the disbelievers; of it there is no preventer."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"From"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"ذِي","d":"dhī","e":"Owner"},{"c":"الْمَعَارِجِ","d":"l-maʿāriji","e":"(of) the ways of ascent"}],"a":{"g":"[It is] from Allah, owner of the ways of ascent."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"تَعْرُجُ","d":"taʿruju","e":"Ascend"},{"c":"الْمَلَائِكَةُ","d":"l-malāikatu","e":"the Angels"},{"c":"وَالرُّوحُ","d":"wal-rūḥu","e":"and the Spirit"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to Him"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"يَوْمٍ","d":"yawmin","e":"a Day"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"[is]"},{"c":"مِقْدَارُهُ","d":"miq'dāruhu","e":"its measure"},{"c":"خَمْسِينَ","d":"khamsīna","e":"(is) fifty"},{"c":"أَلْفَ","d":"alfa","e":"thousand"},{"c":"سَنَةٍ","d":"sanatin","e":"year(s)"}],"a":{"g":"The angels and the Spirit will ascend to Him during a Day the extent of which is fifty thousand years."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"فَاصْبِرْ","d":"fa-iṣ'bir","e":"So be patient"},{"c":"صَبْرًا","d":"ṣabran","e":"a patience"},{"c":"جَمِيلًا","d":"jamīlan","e":"good"}],"a":{"g":"So be patient with gracious patience."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"Indeed they"},{"c":"يَرَوْنَهُ","d":"yarawnahu","e":"see it"},{"c":"بَعِيدًا","d":"baʿīdan","e":"(as) far off"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, they see it [as] distant,"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَنَرَاهُ","d":"wanarāhu","e":"But We see it"},{"c":"قَرِيبًا","d":"qarīban","e":"near"}],"a":{"g":"But We see it [as] near."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"تَكُونُ","d":"takūnu","e":"will be"},{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"l-samāu","e":"the sky"},{"c":"كَالْمُهْلِ","d":"kal-muh'li","e":"like molten copper"}],"a":{"g":"On the Day the sky will be like murky oil,"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَتَكُونُ","d":"watakūnu","e":"And will be"},{"c":"الْجِبَالُ","d":"l-jibālu","e":"the mountains"},{"c":"كَالْعِهْنِ","d":"kal-ʿih'ni","e":"like wool"}],"a":{"g":"And the mountains will be like wool,"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَسْءَلُ","d":"yasalu","e":"will ask"},{"c":"حَمِيمٌ","d":"ḥamīmun","e":"a friend"},{"c":"حَمِيمًا","d":"ḥamīman","e":"(of) a friend"}],"a":{"g":"And no friend will ask [anything of] a friend,"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"يُبَصَّرُونَهُمْ","d":"yubaṣṣarūnahum","e":"They will be made to see each other"},{"c":"يَوَدُّ","d":"yawaddu","e":"Would wish"},{"c":"الْمُجْرِمُ","d":"l-muj'rimu","e":"the criminal"},{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"if"},{"c":"يَفْتَدِي","d":"yaftadī","e":"he (could be) ransomed"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"عَذَابِ","d":"ʿadhābi","e":"(the) punishment"},{"c":"يَوْمِئِذٍ","d":"yawmi-idhin","e":"(of) that Day"},{"c":"بِبَنِيهِ","d":"bibanīhi","e":"by his children"}],"a":{"g":"They will be shown each other. The criminal will wish that he could be ransomed from the punishment of that Day by his children"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَصَاحِبَتِهِ","d":"waṣāḥibatihi","e":"And his spouse"},{"c":"وَأَخِيهِ","d":"wa-akhīhi","e":"and his brother"}],"a":{"g":"And his wife and his brother"}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"وَفَصِيلَتِهِ","d":"wafaṣīlatihi","e":"And his nearest kindred"},{"c":"الَّتِي","d":"allatī","e":"who"},{"c":"تُءْوِيهِ","d":"tu'wīhi","e":"sheltered him"}],"a":{"g":"And his nearest kindred who shelter him"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) on"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"جَمِيعًا","d":"jamīʿan","e":"all"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"يُنْجِيهِ","d":"yunjīhi","e":"it (could) save him"}],"a":{"g":"And whoever is on earth entirely [so] then it could save him."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"By no means!"},{"c":"إِنَّهَا","d":"innahā","e":"Indeed it (is)"},{"c":"لَظَى","d":"laẓā","e":"surely a Flame of Hell"}],"a":{"g":"No! Indeed, it is the Flame [of Hell],"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"نَزَّاعَةً","d":"nazzāʿatan","e":"A remover"},{"c":"لِلشَّوَى","d":"lilshawā","e":"of the skin of the head"}],"a":{"g":"A remover of exteriors."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"تَدْعُوا","d":"tadʿū","e":"Inviting"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(him) who"},{"c":"أَدْبَرَ","d":"adbara","e":"turned his back"},{"c":"وَتَوَلَّى","d":"watawallā","e":"and went away"}],"a":{"g":"It invites he who turned his back [on truth] and went away [from obedience]"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَمَعَ","d":"wajamaʿa","e":"And collected"},{"c":"فَأَوْعَى","d":"fa-awʿā","e":"and hoarded"}],"a":{"g":"And collected [wealth] and hoarded."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانَ","d":"l-insāna","e":"the man"},{"c":"خُلِقَ","d":"khuliqa","e":"was created"},{"c":"هَلُوعًا","d":"halūʿan","e":"anxious"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, mankind was created anxious:"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"مَسَّهُ","d":"massahu","e":"touches him"},{"c":"الشَّرُّ","d":"l-sharu","e":"the evil"},{"c":"جَزُوعًا","d":"jazūʿan","e":"distressed"}],"a":{"g":"When evil touches him, impatient,"}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"مَسَّهُ","d":"massahu","e":"touches him"},{"c":"الْخَيْرُ","d":"l-khayru","e":"the good"},{"c":"مَنُوعًا","d":"manūʿan","e":"withholding"}],"a":{"g":"And when good touches him, withholding [of it],"}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"الْمُصَلِّينَ","d":"l-muṣalīna","e":"those who pray"}],"a":{"g":"Except the observers of prayer -"}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"at"},{"c":"صَلَاتِهِمْ","d":"ṣalātihim","e":"their prayer"},{"c":"دَائِمُونَ","d":"dāimūna","e":"(are) constant"}],"a":{"g":"Those who are constant in their prayer"}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"أَمْوَالِهِمْ","d":"amwālihim","e":"their wealth"},{"c":"حَقٌّ","d":"ḥaqqun","e":"(is) a right"},{"c":"مَعْلُومٌ","d":"maʿlūmun","e":"known"}],"a":{"g":"And those within whose wealth is a known right"}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"لِلسَّائِلِ","d":"lilssāili","e":"For the one who asks"},{"c":"وَالْمَحْرُومِ","d":"wal-maḥrūmi","e":"and the deprived"}],"a":{"g":"For the petitioner and the deprived -"}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"يُصَدِّقُونَ","d":"yuṣaddiqūna","e":"accept (the) truth"},{"c":"بِيَوْمِ","d":"biyawmi","e":"(of the) Day"},{"c":"الدِّينِ","d":"l-dīni","e":"(of) the Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"And those who believe in the Day of Recompense"}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"عَذَابِ","d":"ʿadhābi","e":"(the) punishment"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"(of) their Lord"},{"c":"مُشْفِقُونَ","d":"mush'fiqūna","e":"(are) fearful"}],"a":{"g":"And those who are fearful of the punishment of their Lord -"}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"عَذَابَ","d":"ʿadhāba","e":"(the) punishment"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"غَيْرُ","d":"ghayru","e":"(is) not"},{"c":"مَأْمُونٍ","d":"mamūnin","e":"to be felt secure (of)"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the punishment of their Lord is not that from which one is safe -"}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"لِفُرُوجِهِمْ","d":"lifurūjihim","e":"their modesty"},{"c":"حَافِظُونَ","d":"ḥāfiẓūna","e":"(are) guardians"}],"a":{"g":"And those who guard their private parts"}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"from"},{"c":"أَزْوَاجِهِمْ","d":"azwājihim","e":"their spouses"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"مَلَكَتْ","d":"malakat","e":"they possess"},{"c":"أَيْمَانُهُمْ","d":"aymānuhum","e":"rightfully"},{"c":"فَإِنَّهُمْ","d":"fa-innahum","e":"then indeed, they"},{"c":"غَيْرُ","d":"ghayru","e":"(are) not"},{"c":"مَلُومِينَ","d":"malūmīna","e":"blameworthy"}],"a":{"g":"Except from their wives or those their right hands possess, for indeed, they are not to be blamed -"}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَنِ","d":"famani","e":"But whoever"},{"c":"ابْتَغَى","d":"ib'taghā","e":"seeks"},{"c":"وَرَاءَ","d":"warāa","e":"beyond"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"فَأُولَئِكَ","d":"fa-ulāika","e":"then those"},{"c":"هُمُ","d":"humu","e":"[they]"},{"c":"الْعَادُونَ","d":"l-ʿādūna","e":"(are) the transgressors"}],"a":{"g":"But whoever seeks beyond that, then they are the transgressors -"}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"لِأَمَانَاتِهِمْ","d":"li-amānātihim","e":"of their trusts"},{"c":"وَعَهْدِهِمْ","d":"waʿahdihim","e":"and their promise"},{"c":"رَاعُونَ","d":"rāʿūna","e":"(are) observers"}],"a":{"g":"And those who are to their trusts and promises attentive"}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"بِشَهَادَاتِهِمْ","d":"bishahādātihim","e":"in their testimonies"},{"c":"قَائِمُونَ","d":"qāimūna","e":"stand firm"}],"a":{"g":"And those who are in their testimonies upright"}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"صَلَاتِهِمْ","d":"ṣalātihim","e":"their prayer"},{"c":"يُحَافِظُونَ","d":"yuḥāfiẓūna","e":"keep a guard"}],"a":{"g":"And those who [carefully] maintain their prayer:"}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"أُولَئِكَ","d":"ulāika","e":"Those"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(will be) in"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"Gardens"},{"c":"مُكْرَمُونَ","d":"muk'ramūna","e":"honored"}],"a":{"g":"They will be in gardens, honored."}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَالِ","d":"famāli","e":"So what is with"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"قِبَلَكَ","d":"qibalaka","e":"before you"},{"c":"مُهْطِعِينَ","d":"muh'ṭiʿīna","e":"(they) hasten"}],"a":{"g":"So what is [the matter] with those who disbelieve, hastening [from] before you, [O Muhammad],"}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"عَنِ","d":"ʿani","e":"On"},{"c":"الْيَمِينِ","d":"l-yamīni","e":"the right"},{"c":"وَعَنِ","d":"waʿani","e":"and on"},{"c":"الشِّمَالِ","d":"l-shimāli","e":"the left"},{"c":"عِزِينَ","d":"ʿizīna","e":"(in) separate groups"}],"a":{"g":"[To sit] on [your] right and [your] left in separate groups?"}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"أَيَطْمَعُ","d":"ayaṭmaʿu","e":"Does long"},{"c":"كُلُّ","d":"kullu","e":"every"},{"c":"امْرِئٍ","d":"im'ri-in","e":"person"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"among them"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"يُدْخَلَ","d":"yud'khala","e":"he enters"},{"c":"جَنَّةَ","d":"jannata","e":"a Garden"},{"c":"نَعِيمٍ","d":"naʿīmin","e":"(of) Delight"}],"a":{"g":"Does every person among them aspire to enter a garden of pleasure?"}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"By no means!"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَاهُمْ","d":"khalaqnāhum","e":"[We] have created them"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"from what"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"they know"}],"a":{"g":"No! Indeed, We have created them from that which they know."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"But nay!"},{"c":"أُقْسِمُ","d":"uq'simu","e":"I swear"},{"c":"بِرَبِّ","d":"birabbi","e":"by (the) Lord"},{"c":"الْمَشَارِقِ","d":"l-mashāriqi","e":"(of) the rising"},{"c":"وَالْمَغَارِبِ","d":"wal-maghāribi","e":"and the settings"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"that We"},{"c":"لَقَادِرُونَ","d":"laqādirūna","e":"(are) surely Able"}],"a":{"g":"So I swear by the Lord of [all] risings and settings that indeed We are able"}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"To"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"نُبَدِّلَ","d":"nubaddila","e":"We replace"},{"c":"خَيْرًا","d":"khayran","e":"(with) better"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"than them;"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"بِمَسْبُوقِينَ","d":"bimasbūqīna","e":"(are) to be outrun"}],"a":{"g":"To replace them with better than them; and We are not to be outdone."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"فَذَرْهُمْ","d":"fadharhum","e":"So leave them"},{"c":"يَخُوضُوا","d":"yakhūḍū","e":"(to) converse vainly"},{"c":"وَيَلْعَبُوا","d":"wayalʿabū","e":"and amuse themselves"},{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"until"},{"c":"يُلَاقُوا","d":"yulāqū","e":"they meet"},{"c":"يَوْمَهُمُ","d":"yawmahumu","e":"their Day"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"which"},{"c":"يُوعَدُونَ","d":"yūʿadūna","e":"they are promised"}],"a":{"g":"So leave them to converse vainly and amuse themselves until they meet their Day which they are promised -"}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يَخْرُجُونَ","d":"yakhrujūna","e":"they will come out"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْأَجْدَاثِ","d":"l-ajdāthi","e":"the graves"},{"c":"سِرَاعًا","d":"sirāʿan","e":"rapidly"},{"c":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","d":"ka-annahum","e":"as if they (were)"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"نُصُبٍ","d":"nuṣubin","e":"a goal"},{"c":"يُوفِضُونَ","d":"yūfiḍūna","e":"hastening"}],"a":{"g":"The Day they will emerge from the graves rapidly as if they were, toward an erected idol, hastening."}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"خَاشِعَةً","d":"khāshiʿatan","e":"Humbled"},{"c":"أَبْصَارُهُمْ","d":"abṣāruhum","e":"their eyes"},{"c":"تَرْهَقُهُمْ","d":"tarhaquhum","e":"will cover them"},{"c":"ذِلَّةٌ","d":"dhillatun","e":"humiliation"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"الْيَوْمُ","d":"l-yawmu","e":"(is) the Day"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"which"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"يُوعَدُونَ","d":"yūʿadūna","e":"promised"}],"a":{"g":"Their eyes humbled, humiliation will cover them. That is the Day which they had been promised."}}}